          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Document Type - ACOG Document (American College of Obstetrician and Gynecologist). This feature allows the user to retrieve information of a specific patient or specific ACOG of a patient. It also provides a facility to retrieve ACOG document in HTML. The document content could be images, Clinical documents, XML, etc. Note: The existence of an OB episode doesn't necessarily mean there will be an accompanying ACOG document.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": "document"
    },
    "urlAlias": "/api-ref/document-type-acog-document",
